  <!-- ── swagger-ui / DOMPurify (springdoc-openapi transitive) ───────────────
       CVE-2026-0540, CVE-2025-15599, CVE-2026-41238, CVE-2026-41239,
       CVE-2026-41240: DOM-based XSS in DOMPurify 3.2.4 bundled in swagger-ui
       5.x. Swagger UI accessible only to authenticated ADMIN users on an
       internal network; attack surface is negligible.
       springdoc-openapi 2.8.x bundles this version; no patched version
       available without a springdoc major bump. -->
  <suppress>
